# The JieLi Linux toolchain archive, reviewed and pinned.
#
# tools/get_toolchain.sh downloads https://pkgman.jieliapp.com/s/linux-toolchain (which redirects to
# JieLi's OSS) and refuses to unpack anything whose SHA-256 is not the value below. That URL serves
# the latest build, so when JieLi replaces it upstream this file has to be reviewed and updated in the
# same commit that uses the new compiler: the failure is loud and names both hashes, on purpose.
#
# JIELI_TOOLCHAIN_SHA256 (repository variable, or the environment) overrides this file. Set it only to
# a hash that was reviewed the same way.
#
# reviewed: jieli-linux-toolchains-20260730.1, clang 4.0.1 for pi32v2, 26 027 508 bytes
